window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>I thought it was over. I was wrong.</b></p> <p>Life has literally thrown me overboard, and my worst fear is I won't be able to catch my breath. The people I've always relied on have betrayed me, and those that I should be afraid of have become more that I ever imagined. </p> <p>Will Jax, Blake, and Morgan save me, or will I have to save myself? I'm surrounded by water and have two choices—sink or swim.</p> <p><b><i>Emerge</i></b><b> is book three in the Salinity Cove series and is reverse harem, mature high school/new adult romance told in multiple POVs. It contains mature scenes and language.</b></p>"; 
